OL,3,CProgramme listings for TUE 16 DEC
OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: Prokofiev
OL,5,     GKate Molleson follows Prokofiev
OL,6,     Gfrom bleak classrooms to a prize-
OL,7,     Gwinning triumph - and a storybook
OL,8,     Gending.
OL,9,G1700FIn Tune
OL,10,     GString quartet Music Box Strings
OL,11,     Gperforms live in studio. We also
OL,12,     Ghear from Paul Bettany -
OL,13,     Gdiscussing the role of Salieri in
OL,14,     Gthe upcoming Amadeus TV series.
OL,15,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,16,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,17,     Gsoundscape of classical music
OL,18,     Gwith a seasonal flavour.
